id: shell-burst
name: Shell Burst
kind: conditions
# Not a Combat Condition: Sturdy Shell (5)'s - its stacks the Combat Rolls given, till the end of the next turn.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Sturdy Shell: the Shell broken - Combat Rolls raised by half its Apparel Bonus (rounded up) until the end of your next turn.
text: >
  Sturdy Shell (5): If your Shell is broken, increase your Combat rolls by 1/2 of its Apparel Bonus (rounded up) until the end of your next turn.

---

[passive]
combatRolls += stacks;
